{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Go ahead is a third-person action-challenge game where you control various test subjects submitted to extreme reflex, coordination, and timing experiments. Set in a clinical, sterile lab environment, the game places you in a series of deadly rooms designed to make you fail \u2014 or force you to evolve.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3874300/extras/1c5682e3e9fb3ef4091bd4c27fd25872.poster.avif?t=1773677750\" width=800 height=250 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3874300/extras/1c5682e3e9fb3ef4091bd4c27fd25872.webm?t=1773677750\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3874300/extras/1c5682e3e9fb3ef4091bd4c27fd25872.mp4?t=1773677750\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Each stage simulates a different phase of a brutal experiment: pixel-perfect jumps, timed traps, moving lasers, rotating blades, and collapsing platforms create a relentless testing ground for both body and mind.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >COOP</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3874300/extras/846b392f07127cb7a69672e35f40bf7c.poster.avif?t=1773677750\" width=780 height=420 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3874300/extras/846b392f07127cb7a69672e35f40bf7c.webm?t=1773677750\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3874300/extras/846b392f07127cb7a69672e35f40bf7c.mp4?t=1773677750\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Face extreme experiments in cooperative mode. Synchronization, timing and decision-making as a duo are essential, as any failure compromises both. Survival depends on collective precision.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >No Mercy</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3874300/extras/10d1c827e29df455a267c89326c3c584.poster.avif?t=1773677750\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3874300/extras/10d1c827e29df455a267c89326c3c584.webm?t=1773677750\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3874300/extras/10d1c827e29df455a267c89326c3c584.mp4?t=1773677750\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Nerion tolerates no failure. Any mistake means immediate elimination, with a single strike. Behind the tests lies a relentless pursuit of peak reflexes and physical agility, ignoring any ethical limits.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You are being watched</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3874300/extras/6f4408821f01b5628c902be6c82b735e.poster.avif?t=1773677750\" width=780 height=420 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3874300/extras/6f4408821f01b5628c902be6c82b735e.webm?t=1773677750\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3874300/extras/6f4408821f01b5628c902be6c82b735e.mp4?t=1773677750\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >But by whom?</p>","achievements":{"highlighted":[{"name":"Without fear","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3874300/d7e5fb1a42599016ebadf1722fad5d9a0265f66f.jpg"},{"name":"Relief","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3874300/8126ed7b201b483228f102f5272b3573f69640aa.jpg"},{"name":"Heads Rolling","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3874300/f040df4e62b5533f5cc0cdcaaa973b6547b1c82d.jpg"},{"name":"Tortuguita","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3874300/fe2dacc098dbcae1c64c7e18eedae0b63a1713f0.jpg"},{"name":"Already","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3874300/30fd9d14fd2496c9482133f29a35630b0d48f80a.jpg"},{"name":"The Chosen!","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3874300/bafbebafa867e1f272489f2fd854916dbf1eb91e.jpg"},{"name":"Persistent","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3874300/b8df00d36cbf84d34e147884f68b196d2020236b.jpg"},{"name":"Welcome","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3874300/400938c82061f89f8f5b4dfd72667095ade88288.jpg"}],"total":8},"background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3874300?t=1773677750","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3874300/d2dea535a13f2869f832be4de4bbaccc8afff0ff/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1773677750","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3874300/f5ebff6bc952bb323174764430975379b04b13f9/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1773677750","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3874300/f5ebff6bc952bb323174764430975379b04b13f9/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1773677750","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Multi-player","id":1},{"description":"Co-op","id":9